g> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-20 11:51:00 +08:00\">23h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>还不如用 cluade $20 。同样价钱，codex 只能做一次就没 5h 了，cc 反而可以做 3-4 次</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18200814\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4676b54daa0f44b885474248e64b6972?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ntdll\" data-uid=\"148771\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ntdll\">ntdll</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-20 13:28:25 +08:00\">21h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>10x pro 足够，没有 5 小时限额，使用额度上，更高的套餐并没有额外的额度，与价格增幅保持一致。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18201174\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/63d904a51dc61bb6bf0627926dd215ca?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Bootis\" data-uid=\"436585\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Bootis\">Bootis</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-20 14:38:20 +08:00\">20h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Jlzeng\">Jlzeng</a> 已经还好了吧，最近常态 70-100tps,开了 fast 100-160</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"是 1 个人就冲那个 100🔪的档位，还是拉三四个去冲那个 500🔪的？ 还有现在的 200🔪档位过了 10.29